const catalog={data:MODEL_CATALOG_SNAPSHOT.data,updated:MODEL_CATALOG_SNAPSHOT.retrievedAt,live:false,query:'',provider:'all',capability:'all',sort:'newest',limit:40};
const providerNames={openai:'OpenAI',anthropic:'Anthropic',google:'Google','x-ai':'xAI',deepseek:'DeepSeek',qwen:'Qwen','meta-llama':'Meta',meta:'Meta',mistralai:'Mistral',moonshotai:'Moonshot AI','z-ai':'Z.ai',minimax:'MiniMax',nvidia:'NVIDIA','black-forest-labs':'Black Forest Labs','bytedance-seed':'ByteDance',bytedance:'ByteDance','ibm-granite':'IBM Granite',cohere:'Cohere',amazon:'Amazon',microsoft:'Microsoft',openrouter:'OpenRouter'};
const family=id=>id.split('/')[0].replace(/^~/,'');
const providerName=id=>providerNames[family(id)]||family(id).split('-').map(s=>s[0]?.toUpperCase()+s.slice(1)).join(' ');
const modelName=m=>m.name.replace(/^[^:]+:\s*/, '');
const canSee=m=>m.architecture?.input_modalities?.includes('image');
const outputs=m=>m.architecture?.output_modalities||['text'];
const isAgentModel=m=>outputs(m).includes('text');
const compactContext=n=>!n?'—':n>=1e6?(n/1e6).toFixed(2).replace(/0+$/,'').replace(/\.$/,'')+'M':Math.round(n/1000)+'K';
function tokenPrice(value){const n=Number(value);return value===undefined||!Number.isFinite(n)||n<0?'Variable':n===0?'$0':'$'+(n*1e6).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:3});}
function logoHtml(id,cls=''){const provider=family(id);const asset=typeof MODEL_LOGOS!=='undefined'?(MODEL_LOGOS[provider]||MODEL_LOGOS[provider==='meta'?'meta-llama':provider]):null;return '<span class="model-logo '+cls+'">'+(asset?'<img src="assets/model-logos/'+encodeURIComponent(asset)+'" alt="'+escapeHtml(providerName(id))+' logo" loading="lazy">':'<span aria-label="'+escapeHtml(providerName(id))+' initials">'+escapeHtml(providerName(id).slice(0,2).toUpperCase())+'</span>')+'</span>';}
function normalizedModels(data){return data.filter(m=>typeof m.id==='string'&&typeof m.name==='string').map(m=>({...m,architecture:m.architecture||{},pricing:m.pricing||{}}));}
catalog.data=normalizedModels(catalog.data);
const preferredProviders=['anthropic','openai','google','x-ai','deepseek','qwen','meta','mistralai','moonshotai','z-ai','minimax','nvidia'];
const modelsPage=document.createElement('section');modelsPage.id='models-page';modelsPage.innerHTML='<div class="models-intro"><span class="eyebrow">THE MIND BEHIND YOUR MISSION</span><h1><span id="catalog-total">'+catalog.data.length+'</span> models.<br><span>One world to observe.</span></h1><p>Choose the mind. Define the mission. Let its coin fund the compute.</p><div class="catalog-source"><span class="catalog-status" id="catalog-status">Saved OpenRouter catalog</span><span>Provider pricing · USD per 1M tokens</span><a href="https://openrouter.ai/models" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on OpenRouter ↗</a></div></div><div class="featured-models" id="featured-models"></div><div class="catalog-toolbar"><label class="catalog-search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="19" height="19" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="m15 15 5 5"/></svg><input id="model-search" type="search" placeholder="Search every model, provider, or model ID" aria-label="Search OpenRouter models"></label><label class="catalog-select"><span>Capability</span><select id="model-capability"><option value="all">All models</option><option value="vision">Image input + text output</option><option value="text">Text output</option><option value="free">Free token pricing</option><option value="image">Image output</option><option value="audio">Audio output</option></select></label><label class="catalog-select"><span>Sort</span><select id="model-sort"><option value="newest">Newest</option><option value="price">Lowest token cost</option><option value="context">Largest context</option><option value="name">Name A–Z</option></select></label></div><div class="provider-filter" id="provider-filter"></div><div class="catalog-table-caption"><span id="catalog-result-count"></span><span>INPUT / OUTPUT PER 1M TOKENS</span></div><div id="model-list" class="model-list"></div><button id="more-models" class="button catalog-more">Show more models</button><p class="catalog-disclaimer">Catalog availability and prices come from OpenRouter. Image, audio, request, and tool charges may apply separately. Free models have usage limits. Choosing a model saves your configuration; open a model preview to run camera analysis through OpenRouter.</p>';
document.querySelector('main').append(modelsPage);
const picker=document.createElement('dialog');picker.id='model-picker';picker.innerHTML='<div class="dialog-head"><span class="eyebrow">OPENROUTER / CHOOSE A MODEL</span><button class="close" id="close-model-picker" aria-label="Close model picker">×</button></div><h2>A mind for your mission.</h2><p>Browse the full catalog. Image-capable models can interpret camera frames.</p><div class="picker-tools"><input id="picker-search" type="search" placeholder="Search models or providers" aria-label="Search model picker"><select id="picker-filter" aria-label="Filter model picker"><option value="all">All models</option><option value="vision">Image input + text output</option><option value="text">Text output</option><option value="free">Free token pricing</option></select></div><div class="picker-count" id="picker-count"></div><div id="picker-list"></div><button class="button catalog-more" id="picker-more">Show more models</button>';
document.body.append(picker);document.querySelector('#close-model-picker').onclick=()=>picker.close();let pickerLimit=30,activeModel=null;
function showModels(){document.body.classList.add('model-mode');window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});document.querySelectorAll('.nav-link').forEach(n=>n.classList.remove('active'));document.querySelector('#models-nav').classList.add('active');renderCatalog();}
function showHome(){document.body.classList.remove('model-mode');document.querySelector('#models-nav').classList.remove('active');}
document.querySelector('#models-nav').onclick=showModels;document.querySelectorAll('[data-nav]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',showHome,{capture:true}));document.querySelectorAll('.brand').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',showHome));
function featuredModels(){return preferredProviders.map(p=>{const candidates=catalog.data.filter(m=>family(m.id)===p&&!m.id.includes(':')&&isAgentModel(m));return candidates.find(canSee)||candidates[0];}).filter(Boolean);}
function renderFeatured(){document.querySelector('#featured-models').innerHTML=featuredModels().map(m=>'<button class="model-card" data-start-model="'+escapeHtml(m.id)+'">'+logoHtml(m.id,'watermark')+'<span class="model-card-provider">'+logoHtml(m.id)+escapeHtml(providerName(m.id))+'</span><strong>'+escapeHtml(modelName(m))+'</strong><span class="model-card-pricing">'+tokenPrice(m.pricing.prompt)+' in · '+tokenPrice(m.pricing.completion)+' out</span><span class="model-card-bottom"><span>'+compactContext(m.context_length)+' context</span><span>'+(canSee(m)?'Image input':'Text input')+'</span></span></button>').join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-start-model]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openLaunch({modelId:b.dataset.startModel}));}
function matchesCapability(m,cap){if(cap==='vision')return canSee(m)&&isAgentModel(m);if(cap==='text')return isAgentModel(m);if(cap==='free')return Number(m.pricing.prompt)===0&&Number(m.pricing.completion)===0;if(cap==='image'||cap==='audio')return outputs(m).some(o=>o.includes(cap));return true;}
function filterModels(query,provider,cap){const q=query.toLowerCase().trim();return catalog.data.filter(m=>(provider==='all'||family(m.id)===provider)&&matchesCapability(m,cap)&&(!q||[m.id,m.name,providerName(m.id)].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(q)));}
function renderProviders(){const counts={};catalog.data.forEach(m=>counts[family(m.id)]=(counts[family(m.id)]||0)+1);const names=[...preferredProviders.filter(p=>counts[p]),...Object.keys(counts).filter(p=>!preferredProviders.includes(p)).sort()];document.querySelector('#provider-filter').innerHTML='<button data-provider="all" class="'+(catalog.provider==='all'?'active':'')+'">All providers <small>'+catalog.data.length+'</small></button>'+names.map(p=>'<button data-provider="'+escapeHtml(p)+'" class="'+(catalog.provider===p?'active':'')+'">'+logoHtml(p+'/model')+'<span>'+escapeHtml(providerName(p+'/model'))+'</span><small>'+counts[p]+'</small></button>').join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-provider]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{catalog.provider=b.dataset.provider;catalog.limit=40;renderProviders();renderCatalog();});}
function modelRow(m,pick=false){return '<div class="model-row">'+(pick?logoHtml(m.id):'<button class="model-preview-logo" data-preview-model="'+escapeHtml(m.id)+'" aria-label="Preview '+escapeHtml(modelName(m))+'">'+logoHtml(m.id)+'</button>')+'<div class="model-name"><strong>'+escapeHtml(modelName(m))+'</strong><small>'+escapeHtml(m.id)+'</small></div><div class="model-capabilities"><span class="'+(canSee(m)&&isAgentModel(m)?'vision-pill':'neutral-pill')+'">'+(canSee(m)&&isAgentModel(m)?'Image + text':outputs(m).join(' + '))+'</span><span>'+compactContext(m.context_length)+' context</span></div><div class="model-prices"><b>'+tokenPrice(m.pricing.prompt)+' <span>/</span> '+tokenPrice(m.pricing.completion)+'</b><small>per 1M input / output tokens</small></div><button class="button small" '+(pick?'data-pick-model':'data-launch-model')+'="'+escapeHtml(m.id)+'">'+(pick?'Select':'Preview')+'</button></div>';}
function renderCatalog(){let list=filterModels(catalog.query,catalog.provider,catalog.capability);if(catalog.sort==='price')list.sort((a,b)=>priceSort(a)-priceSort(b));else if(catalog.sort==='context')list.sort((a,b)=>b.context_length-a.context_length);else if(catalog.sort==='name')list.sort((a,b)=>modelName(a).localeCompare(modelName(b)));else list.sort((a,b)=>b.created-a.created);document.querySelector('#catalog-total').textContent=catalog.data.length;document.querySelector('#catalog-result-count').textContent=list.length+' models · showing '+Math.min(catalog.limit,list.length);document.querySelector('#model-list').innerHTML=list.length?list.slice(0,catalog.limit).map(m=>modelRow(m)).join(''):'<div class="empty-state"><b>No matching models</b><p>Try a different search or provider.</p><button id="reset-models" class="button">Clear filters</button></div>';document.querySelector('#more-models').hidden=list.length<=catalog.limit;document.querySelectorAll('[data-launch-model]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openLaunch({modelId:b.dataset.launchModel}));const reset=document.querySelector('#reset-models');if(reset)reset.onclick=()=>{catalog.query='';catalog.provider='all';catalog.capability='all';document.querySelector('#model-search').value='';document.querySelector('#model-capability').value='all';renderProviders();renderCatalog();};}
function priceSort(m){const a=Number(m.pricing.prompt),b=Number(m.pricing.completion);return a>=0&&b>=0?a+b:Infinity;}
document.querySelector('#model-search').oninput=e=>{catalog.query=e.target.value;catalog.limit=40;renderCatalog();};document.querySelector('#model-capability').onchange=e=>{catalog.capability=e.target.value;catalog.limit=40;renderCatalog();};document.querySelector('#model-sort').onchange=e=>{catalog.sort=e.target.value;renderCatalog();};document.querySelector('#more-models').onclick=()=>{catalog.limit+=60;renderCatalog();};
function renderPicker(){const list=filterModels(document.querySelector('#picker-search').value,'all',document.querySelector('#picker-filter').value);document.querySelector('#picker-count').textContent=list.length+' models · prices per 1M tokens';document.querySelector('#picker-list').innerHTML=list.length?list.slice(0,pickerLimit).map(m=>modelRow(m,true)).join(''):'<div class="empty-state">No models match this search.</div>';document.querySelector('#picker-more').hidden=list.length<=pickerLimit;document.querySelectorAll('[data-pick-model]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const m=catalog.data.find(m=>m.id===b.dataset.pickModel);if(m){activeModel=m;updateSelectedModel();picker.close();document.querySelector('#launch-form')?.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));}});}
document.querySelector('#picker-search').oninput=()=>{pickerLimit=30;renderPicker();};document.querySelector('#picker-filter').onchange=()=>{pickerLimit=30;renderPicker();};document.querySelector('#picker-more').onclick=()=>{pickerLimit+=50;renderPicker();};
window.initLaunchModels=(form,seed)=>{activeModel=catalog.data.find(m=>m.id===seed?.modelId)||catalog.data.find(m=>m.id==='google/gemini-2.5-flash')||catalog.data.find(m=>canSee(m)&&isAgentModel(m));const block=document.createElement('div');block.className='launch-model-section';block.innerHTML='<label class="launch-model-label">Agent model <span>via '+escapeHtml(catalog.providerName||'OpenRouter')+'</span></label><button id="selected-model" class="selected-model" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog"></button><input type="hidden" name="modelId" id="launch-model-id"><div id="model-fit-note"></div>';form.prepend(block);document.querySelector('#selected-model').onclick=()=>{document.querySelector('#picker-search').value='';document.querySelector('#picker-filter').value='all';pickerLimit=30;renderPicker();picker.showModal();};updateSelectedModel();};
function updateSelectedModel(){const button=document.querySelector('#selected-model');if(!button||!activeModel)return;button.innerHTML=logoHtml(activeModel.id)+'<span><b>'+escapeHtml(modelName(activeModel))+'</b><small>'+escapeHtml(providerName(activeModel.id))+' · '+tokenPrice(activeModel.pricing.prompt)+' in / '+tokenPrice(activeModel.pricing.completion)+' out per 1M</small></span><span class="change-model">Change</span>';document.querySelector('#launch-model-id').value=activeModel.id;document.querySelector('#model-fit-note').textContent=canSee(activeModel)&&isAgentModel(activeModel)?'Image input supported · suitable for a camera analysis stage.':isAgentModel(activeModel)?'Text-only model. A separate vision stage must interpret camera frames first.':'This model does not return text. An additional agent pipeline is needed for monitoring and alerts.';}
window.modelDailyEstimate=(form,obs)=>{const m=catalog.data.find(v=>v.id===form.elements.modelId?.value);if(!m)return NaN;const p=Number(m.pricing.prompt),c=Number(m.pricing.completion);if(!Number.isFinite(p)||!Number.isFinite(c)||p<0||c<0)return NaN;return obs*(p*1500+c*250);};
window.draftModelMetadata=form=>{const m=catalog.data.find(v=>v.id===form.elements.modelId?.value);const obs=1440/Number(form.elements.interval.value)*Number(form.elements.cameras.value),cost=window.modelDailyEstimate(form,obs);return {modelId:m?.id||null,modelName:m?.name||null,modelPricing:m?.pricing||{},pricingAsOf:catalog.updated,cost:Number.isFinite(cost)?cost:0,costUnknown:!Number.isFinite(cost),walletAddress:typeof connectedWallet!=='undefined'?connectedWallet?.address||null:null};};
const oldOpenMission=openMission;openMission=function(id){oldOpenMission(id);const m=drafts.find(v=>v.id===id);if(m?.modelId){const area=document.querySelector('#info-body .draft-meta');area.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<div class="full"><span>AGENT MODEL / OPENROUTER</span><b>'+escapeHtml(m.modelName||m.modelId)+'</b></div>');}if(m){const deleteButton=document.createElement('button');deleteButton.className='text-button delete-draft';deleteButton.textContent='Delete this draft';deleteButton.onclick=()=>{const remaining=drafts.filter(d=>d.id!==id);try{localStorage.setItem('parallax-drafts',JSON.stringify(remaining));drafts=remaining;renderRows();document.querySelector('#info-dialog').close();}catch{deleteButton.textContent='Could not delete. Try again.';}};document.querySelector('#info-body').append(deleteButton);}};
document.querySelector('#x-link').onclick=()=>{document.querySelector('#toast').textContent='X profile coming soon.';document.querySelector('#toast').classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>document.querySelector('#toast').classList.remove('show'),2600);};
renderFeatured();renderProviders();renderCatalog();
(async()=>{const controller=new AbortController();const timer=setTimeout(()=>controller.abort(),10000);try{const response=await fetch('/api/models',{signal:controller.signal});if(!response.ok)throw new Error('Catalog unavailable');const payload=await response.json();if(!Array.isArray(payload.data)||!payload.data.length)throw new Error('Empty catalog');catalog.data=normalizedModels(payload.data);catalog.updated=new Date().toISOString();catalog.live=true;catalog.providerName=payload.providerName||'OpenRouter';document.querySelector('#catalog-status').textContent='Live '+catalog.providerName+' catalog · updated now';const source=document.querySelector('.catalog-source a');source.textContent='View on '+catalog.providerName+' ↗';if(payload.sourceUrl)source.href=payload.sourceUrl;document.querySelector('#model-picker .eyebrow').textContent=catalog.providerName.toUpperCase()+' / CHOOSE A MODEL';if(catalog.providerName==='Orbio')document.querySelector('.catalog-disclaimer').textContent='Catalog availability and prices come from Orbio Additional image, request and provider charges may apply The configured key account pays for observations';renderFeatured();renderProviders();renderCatalog();}catch{document.querySelector('#catalog-status').textContent='Saved catalog · '+new Date(catalog.updated).toLocaleDateString('en-US',{month:'short',day:'numeric',year:'numeric'});}finally{clearTimeout(timer);}})();


